      "reason": "The document title explicitly includes the phrase 'a systematic review,' identifying the report as a systematic review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_1_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "marginalia_0",
      "quote": "System dynamics modeling for cancer prevention and control: A systematic review.",
      "reason": "The title states the main topic and objective of the review — system dynamics modeling applied to cancer prevention and control — which conveys the subject (population/area and intervention/approach) of the review."
